  "description": "Agentic Finance MCP server. Agent402 is the payment and trust layer for agentic commerce: agents find, pay for and verify paid calls to Agent402, across x402 and MPP, with signed receipts on successful direct calls. 500+ ready tools on the same rails: skill packs too, USDC or USDG on 14 chains, or free via proof-of-work. Catalog: PDFs and OCR, SEC EDGAR filings, US macro series, weather, chain reads, live crypto data, deterministic stats & forecasting, compression, payments. Open source, self-hostable.",
